  "title": "The Free Repo With 230,000 Stars That Upgrades Claude Code",
  "description": "Comment \"ECC\" and I'll send you the link\n\nECC, short for Everything Claude Code, is a free repo with over two hundred thousand stars that bundles a whole agent setup into one download.\n\nYou get sixty-seven ready-made agents and nearly three hundred skills, all wired to work together out of the box.\n\nIt's portable too, so the same setup runs in Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and OpenCode.\n\nIt's the drop-in answer if you don't want to spend weeks configuring your own.",
